  "content": {
    "id": "p79-q1",
    "type": "question",
    "label": "1",
    "prompt": "Consider these scores: $2, 3, 3, 3, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5$.",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [
      {
        "id": "p79-q1-a",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "a",
        "prompt": "Calculate the mode. Is it a useful measure of centre for this dataset? Give a reason.",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": {
            "format": "maths-editor-document-v1",
            "version": 1,
            "blocks": [
              {
                "id": "p79-q1-a-answer",
                "type": "paragraph",
                "fontSize": null,
                "align": "left",
                "spaceBefore": 0,
                "spaceAfter": 2,
                "lineHeight": 1.4,
                "indent": 0,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "type": "math",
                    "latex": "5",
                    "display": false
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": ". It represents the majority of the scores, although it is also the largest value. Its usefulness depends on the purpose of the summary.",
                    "marks": []
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          "worked": "2 occurs once, 3 occurs three times and 5 occurs five times. The mode is $5$.\n\nIt usefully describes the most common score: five of the nine scores are 5. Being the largest value does not make it unsuitable. The mean is another useful summary when every score is to contribute.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 12
      },
      {
        "id": "p79-q1-b",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "b",
        "prompt": "Calculate the median. Is it a useful measure of centre for this dataset? Give a reason.",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": {
            "format": "maths-editor-document-v1",
            "version": 1,
            "blocks": [
              {
                "id": "p79-q1-b-answer",
                "type": "paragraph",
                "fontSize": null,
                "align": "left",
                "spaceBefore": 0,
                "spaceAfter": 2,
                "lineHeight": 1.4,
                "indent": 0,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "type": "math",
                    "latex": "5",
                    "display": false
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": ". It is the middle ordered score and represents the majority value. Being the maximum does not make the median unsuitable.",
                    "marks": []
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          "worked": "Ordered scores: $2, 3, 3, 3, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5$.\n\nThe fifth of the nine scores is the middle score, so the median is $5$.\n\nIt is useful for describing the middle observation and also represents the majority value. It does not use the precise value of every score; the mean is useful when all scores are to contribute.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 16
      },
      {
        "id": "p79-q1-c",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "c",
        "prompt": "Calculate the mean. Is the mean a good measure of centre for these scores?",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": {
            "format": "maths-editor-document-v1",
            "version": 1,
            "blocks": [
              {
                "id": "p79-q1-c-answer",
                "type": "paragraph",
                "fontSize": null,
                "align": "left",
                "spaceBefore": 0,
                "spaceAfter": 2,
                "lineHeight": 1.4,
                "indent": 0,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "type": "math",
                    "latex": "4",
                    "display": false
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": ". Yes, if every score is to contribute to the summary; 5 is also useful for describing the middle or most common score.",
                    "marks": []
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\bar{x}&=\\frac{2+3+3+3+5+5+5+5+5}{9}\\\\\\bar{x}&=\\frac{36}{9}\\\\\\bar{x}&=4\\end{align*}$$\n\nYes, the mean is useful when every score is to contribute to the summary. A preference for 5 is also reasonable when describing the middle or most common score.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 32
      }
    ]
  },
